# Cargo build output and downloaded TQ market snapshots. The repo root .gitignore only
# names market-seederv2's target/ and cache/, so v3 carries its own.
target/
cache/

# data/ is deliberately NOT ignored. doc/JITA_INDEX_SEED_PLAN.md decision 7 commits
# data/price-manifest.json to the repo: captured CCP prices are permanent, so the manifest
# is what makes every environment seed identically and every rebuild offline and reviewable.
# Ignoring it would silently re-capture live TQ prices on each machine.
